        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-422 (ensure controlled execution — Markdown &amp; Clearance Execution (PA-64.2).) | - CTL-422 (price-tag accuracy — links to W69); operational: Store Manager clearance-zone setup sign-off
Owner: Store Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
