        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-422 (ensure controlled execution — Markdown &amp; Clearance Execution (PA-64.2).) | - operational: clearance-disposition approval with separate tracking; Category Manager disposition sign-off
Owner: Merchandising Planner</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
