      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vendor agreement includes markdown support
Frequency: Per season; ~50–100 seasonal vendors
Volume: ~50–100 vendors/season
Owner: Finance Analyst
Participants: Finance Analyst, Category Mgr, Vendor
Source: workflow W2394 — Vendor Markdown Allowance Processing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2394_LaneSet2">
