        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Coordinator verifies: clearance prices match system, clearance labels applied, clearance zone properly merchandised, non-clearance items not incorrectly discounted; non-compliance corrected immediately
Responsible (R): Merch Coordinator / Regional Ops Mgr
Accountable (A): VP Store Operations
Duration: 2–3 hours per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2395_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2395_Flow9</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2395_End5" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2395_Flow9</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2395_Annotation6">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-176 (ensure markdown &amp; clearance pricing compliance.) | - CTL-422 (price-tag accuracy — links to W69); operational: Merchandising Coordinator per-event sign-off
Owner: Merchandising Coordinator</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
