Responsible (R): HR Manager / Store Manager
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: 1 day/event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2396_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2396_Flow9</bpmn:outgoing>
